WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.058
[Soft instrumental music] Folio. Your details. Within reach.

00:03.058 --> 00:05.009
Keep identity, education, experience, and supporting files together.

00:05.009 --> 00:11.312
Search familiar words and synonyms. Copy the exact field value you need.

00:11.312 --> 00:22.011
Drag a field into place. Edit its value, then save the same record.

00:22.011 --> 00:28.503
Open a PNG or JPG inside Folio. Zoom in, then fit the image to the view.

00:28.503 --> 00:37.015
Switch directly to the next PDF attachment. Turn a page and zoom in.

00:37.015 --> 00:46.002
Close the preview, rename the document, and copy its managed file path.

00:46.002 --> 00:53.503
Choose dark mode and a new accent color.

00:53.503 --> 00:56.600
Switch between English and Chinese while preserving your workspace.

00:56.600 --> 01:00.600
Folio. Less searching. More ready. [Music fades]
